---
import DocLayout from '../layouts/DocLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---

<DocLayout
  title="Contact"
  description={`Contact ${SITE.name} to report a calculation error, a changed tax rate, or to send feedback on the calculator.`}
>
  <p>
    Email{' '}
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>
      <strong>{SITE.contactEmail}</strong>
    </a>
    .
  </p>

  <h2>Reporting a calculation error</h2>
  <p>
    Accuracy is the whole point of this calculator, so error reports are the most useful thing you
    can send. To help us reproduce it, please include:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      The share link for your calculation (it contains your inputs, so check you are happy to send
      them)
    </li>
    <li>
      The figure you expected, and where it came from: your payslip, Form 130 or your employer
    </li>
    <li>If a rate or rule has changed, a link to the official notification or Act</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What we cannot help with</h2>
  <p>
    We cannot give personal tax advice, review your payslip or file returns. For that, speak to your
    employer's payroll team or a chartered accountant.
  </p>
</DocLayout>
